<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11388" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάνευθε</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰν</span>], and before vowels <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπανάχωρ-θεν</span></b> , strengthd. for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευθε,</span>
		Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>afar off, far away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κιών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεῦγον ἔπειτ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.478
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Prep.
			with gen.,<i>far from, aloof from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἄλλων ἀ. θεῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.189
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοκήων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θεῶν</span>
			<i>without</i> their <i>knowledge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.549
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>out from, issuing from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δ᾽ ἀ. σέλας γένετ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.374
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
